# Engine installation smoke test; not a material production calculation.
units lj
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
lattice fcc 0.8442
region cell block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box 1 cell
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 1.0
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5
velocity all create 1.0 87287 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
neighbor 0.3 bin
fix integrate all nve
timestep 0.002
thermo 10
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press vol
run 100
